OL,3,GNEWSAWhat can be done about the A120's
OL,4,Adead deer problem?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of deer lying dead along the
OL,7,FA120 has been a hot topic in a corner
OL,8,Fof Essex recently.
OL,10,FPeople living near Great Dunmow believe
OL,11,Fthe problem is getting worse, and
OL,12,Ffigures from Uttlesford District
OL,13,FCouncil back them up.
OL,15,FSo what can be done to improve the
OL,16,Fsituation?
OL,18,FOn a two-mile (about 3km) stretch of
OL,19,Fthe A120 near Great Dunmow, Sam Mannock
OL,20,Fcounts 15 dead deer lying by the road.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
